### PayVerse — user-service through the gateway. Run 01-auth.http steps 1–2 first (sets {{accessToken}}).

### My profile (created automatically from the auth.user-registered event)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update profile
PUT {{gateway}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Asha Verma", "email": "asha@example.com", "dateOfBirth": "1995-05-20" }

### KYC status
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/users/me/kyc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### NONE → MIN_KYC (MOCK verifier: numbers containing 9999 are rejected, e.g. ABCDE9999F)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/users/me/kyc/min
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "documentType": "PAN", "documentNumber": "ABCDE1234F", "fullName": "Asha Verma", "dateOfBirth": "1995-05-20" }

### MIN_KYC → FULL_KYC: Aadhaar (Verhoeff-valid, e.g. 234123412346) + document (JPEG/PNG/PDF, ≤ 5 MB)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/users/me/kyc/full
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=payverse

--payverse
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="aadhaarNumber"

234123412346
--payverse
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="document"; filename="aadhaar.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

%PDF-1.7 mock document
--payverse--

### Link a bank account (first one becomes primary; max 5)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/users/me/bank-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accountNumber": "123456789012", "ifsc": "HDFC0001234", "holderName": "Asha Verma" }

> {% client.global.set("bankAccountId", response.body.id); %}

### List bank accounts (masked)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/users/me/bank-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Make primary
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/users/me/bank-accounts/{{bankAccountId}}/primary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Unlink
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/v1/users/me/bank-accounts/{{bankAccountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Save a beneficiary (MOBILE | VPA | BANK_ACCOUNT + ifsc)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/users/me/beneficiaries
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "VPA", "value": "ravi@payverse", "nickname": "Ravi" }

###
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/users/me/beneficiaries
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "BANK_ACCOUNT", "value": "987654321098", "ifsc": "SBIN0000001", "nickname": "Landlord" }

### List beneficiaries
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/users/me/beneficiaries
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
